(
    title: "Dragster",
    developer: Some("David Crane"),
    description: Some("Activision\'s very first cartridge: a drag race measured in hundredths, over in under six seconds. Rev on the countdown without popping the clutch early, then snap through four gears — mistime a shift and the engine blows in a cloud of smoke. The perfect run is 5.57 seconds, a figure that eventually unseated a 35-year-old fraudulent 5.51 \'world record\' and its holder. Two lanes, so a second player can blow an engine right beside you."),
